WEBVTT

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.666
The company will change the salary merit

00:00:04.686 --> 00:00:07.206
and promotion effectiveness update

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:09.697
from JANUARY to APRIL,

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.330
changing only the timing

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:15.676
in alignment with market best practices.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:17.768
The current cycle runs

00:00:17.788 --> 00:00:19.758
from JANUARY to DECEMBER.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.578
Here's the new proposed cycle.

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:28.495
The bonus will be paid in MARCH.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:31.447
In APRIL, merit increases and

00:00:31.467 --> 00:00:34.123
promotion action will be reflected.

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:36.812
During the transition year,

00:00:36.832 --> 00:00:38.736
this transition applies to the

00:00:38.756 --> 00:00:41.130
2027 IMPLEMENTATION YEAR only.

00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:44.205
For leave balance, you will receive

00:00:44.225 --> 00:00:46.499
a three-month balance in JANUARY.

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:48.063
And from APRIL 2027,

00:00:48.083 --> 00:00:50.041
a new annual balance begins,

00:00:50.061 --> 00:00:52.489
based on the updated grades.

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:56.217
And the same will applied on the

00:00:56.237 --> 00:00:58.495
vacation allowance where the basic salary

00:00:58.515 --> 00:01:00.272
paid for 3 months and from April

00:01:00.292 --> 00:01:02.631
will reflect the new basic salary.

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:07.541
Comes to the merit, it will cover 15 months,

00:01:07.561 --> 00:01:09.869
while the percentage itself does not change

00:01:09.889 --> 00:01:11.313
— only the months.

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.215
For further clarification,

00:01:16.235 --> 00:01:18.215
contact HR personnel.
